+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
+
+// Kiln OS (AD5X): the print start steps on the PRINT STATUS screen, from the
+// texts Kiln's PRINT_START prints (klipper/macros/print_start.cfg and
+// ad5x.cfg's _CHECK_Z in the Kiln OS repo). Each step is an M117
+// (display_status.message) and the same text as an "echo: " console line.
+// The cases replay those texts as the printer sends them and read the rows the
+// screen draws: done rows in the order they ran, the running step labelled
+// with the printer's own words, then the steps still to come in the order the
+// AD5X runs them.
